{"term":{"label":"親","occurrences":2,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii","title":"盡心下","description":"孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"昭","id":"昭"},{"form":"棗","id":"棗"},{"form":"殺","id":"殺"},{"form":"炙","id":"炙"},{"form":"父","id":"父"},{"form":"知","id":"知"},{"form":"羊","id":"羊"},{"form":"聞","id":"聞"},{"form":"至","id":"至"},{"form":"見","id":"見"},{"form":"親","id":"親"},{"form":"食","id":"食"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.7419373447293773,"source":"人","target":"今"},{"weight":1.0986122886681098,"source":"人","target":"殺"},{"weight":0.7419373447293773,"source":"人","target":"親"},{"weight":0.5187937934151675,"source":"人","target":"父"},{"weight":1.4350845252893227,"source":"人","target":"昭"},{"weight":0.5187937934151675,"source":"人","target":"心"},{"weight":1.4069136483226263,"source":"知","target":"今"},{"weight":1.540445040947149,"source":"知","target":"殺"},{"weight":2.1000608288825715,"source":"知","target":"親"},{"weight":0.3953127366441464,"source":"知","target":"何"},{"weight":2.3877429013343527,"source":"知","target":"見"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"知","target":"聞"},{"weight":1.589235205116581,"source":"至","target":"心"},{"weight":1.8123787564307907,"source":"至","target":"今"},{"weight":1.9947003132247452,"source":"心","target":"今"},{"weight":3.380994674344636,"source":"羊","target":"棗"},{"weight":2.6878474937846906,"source":"羊","target":"食"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"羊","target":"炙"},{"weight":3.1986731175506815,"source":"炙","target":"親"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"炙","target":"棗"},{"weight":1.493925025312256,"source":"炙","target":"何"},{"weight":2.505525936990736,"source":"炙","target":"食"},{"weight":2.6878474937846906,"so